# Copy to .env and fill in as needed. .env is gitignored -- never commit
# a real key.

# NPS Gallery (npgallery.nps.gov) has no published API and needs no key
# for the current scraper (nps_client.py) -- it's plain HTML scraping.
# Nothing required here yet for the NPS-only phase.

